# Pending thesis revisions

The recovered build entry is now
`thesis/candidate/main.tex`.  Its inputs under
`thesis/candidate/recovered/` and `thesis/candidate/legacy/` are the preserved
14 September baseline, not the place to integrate new prose.  Keep them intact
as a comparison baseline.  Integration can add ordinary, visible overlay
files directly under `thesis/candidate/` and change `main.tex` to select them.
Nothing in the production assembly should point back into `.git/codex/`.

